### =============================================================================
### SUITE COMPLETA DE PRUEBAS DEL PARCIAL: CASOS C-01 A C-16
### Consigna Parcial §4.2
### =============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### --- CASO C-01: Login exitoso con cookie HttpOnly y sin token en body ---
# @name c01_login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/yo

### --- CASO C-02: Rechazo de Authorization: Bearer o sin cookie ---
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/yo
Authorization: Bearer token_no_permitido_en_body_o_header

